  "statement": "Use right endpoints to find the area under $f(x)=2x+1$ on $[[$a],[$a]+2]$.\n\n[__________]{a}",
  "hints": [
    "The width is $2/n$.",
    "Substitute $a+2i/n$ into $2x+1$.",
    "Add the constant and linear terms separately."
  ],
  "solution": "$R_n=(2/n)(n(2[$a]+1)+(4/n)n(n+1)/2)=4[$a]+2+4(n+1)/n$, so the limit is $4[$a]+6$.",
  "answers": {
    "a": {
      "type": "number",
      "value": "4*a+6",
      "feedback": [
